N:The tune is attributed to David Owen (1712–1741), the harper Dafydd y Garreg Wen; the words are by Ceiriog. Steve's ABC has first and second endings for verses 1 and 2 and a third for verse 3, four bars each, differing only in their first bar: here the last verse is written out.
